45765	Q0	zis224	42	4.323447	instruments_tools	The scale records attitudes towards foreigners with four items and is regularly used in the ALLBUS.
45765	Q0	zis202	43	4.3046265	instruments_tools	The scale measures tied goods with ten items. One can speak of a person being bound by goods if the self expression of the person is to a very large extent made by material goods.
