50072	Q0	zis98	79	2.324154	instruments_tools	The item battery for the evaluation of discussions documented here is an additional module of the Münster Questionnaire for Evaluation . The additional module has the abbreviation MFE ZDi .
50072	Q0	zis103	80	2.309598	instruments_tools	The item battery for the evaluation of group work documented here is an additional module of the Münster Questionnaire for Evaluation . The additional module has the abbreviation MFE ZGr .
