67775	Q0	zis297	92	2.2645009	instruments_tools	The Information Elaboration Survey FIT measures the collective perception in a team that all members share discuss and integrate their specific knowledge with the aim of developing new ideas and solutions. The FIT is based on major insights from international team research and identifies five process steps capturing the wholistic elaboration and integration of diverse knowledge. The quality of information elaboration is a major predictor of various criteria of team effectiveness. The survey shows very good psychometric properties. Substantial correlations with other constructs point to its convergent and criterion validity.
67775	Q0	zis333_exz	93	2.2597854	instruments_tools	We developed a German version of the Human Flourishing Scale Flourish Index FI and Secure Flourish Index SFI in a multi stage translation and scale testing process to measure distinct domains of subjective well being and overall flourishing. The FI consists of five sub domains happiness and life satisfaction physical and mental health meaning and purpose character and virtue and close social relationships. The SFI adds the sub domain financial and material stability which is thought necessary to sustain the other domains over time. The twelve item SFI is a measure of flourishing that is short enough to be practical in a variety of settings including in the workplace and in population surveys. It is comprehensive in its assessment of the most essential domains of complete well being.
67775	Q0	zis69	94	2.2367043	instruments_tools	This questionnaire measures the willingness to refrain from certain behaviors for the sake of the environment.
