60151	Q0	zis198	27	3.2863262	instruments_tools	The items documented here were used together with other item batteries to measure attitudes towards foreigners among other things. So far the documentation of the items has only been carried out on the basis of the ALLBUS code books. Therefore information on instrument development evaluation the quality of the overall instrument and the theoretical background must be sought in the ALLBUS bibliography via the internet.
