6171	Q0	zis190	1	13.494323	instruments_tools	This scale measures the subjective perception of conflict groups with 15 items. According to Anthony Giddens model class conflicts are classified on the second level of class consciousness. The scale is intended to record how conflicts of interest between different groups are perceived.
6171	Q0	zis31	2	12.086487	instruments_tools	The questionnaire covers the five conflict areas 1 Quantitative Workload Problems 2 Orientation Deficits 3 Feedback Deficits 4 Professional Conflicts and 5 Sender Conflicts. The development of the questionnaire is based on the assumption that structural company specific characteristics are decisive for role conflicts.
