29421	Q0	zis319_exz	22	3.4472883	instruments_tools	The five dimensional curiosity scale revised 5DCR by Kashdan et al. 2020 is the most comprehensive curiosity inventory available to date. 5DCR measures six facets of curiosity with four items each Joyous Exploration Deprivation Sensitivity Stress Tolerance Social Curiosity General Social Curiosity Covert Thrill Seeking. The scale was validated for the English speaking population in the U.S. N 483 and N 460 Kashdan et al. 2020 and the UK N 483 Grüning Lechner 2022 . 5DCR s six facets reliability factorial validity and convergent and discriminant validity are supported. The instrument shows at least partial scalar measurement invariance across age sex education and country i.e. compared with Germany .
